### 08 — THE HERO EXPERIENCE: THE SIGNATURE 3D MOMENT

The homepage hero must be the most memorable element of the entire experience.

Create an immersive, cinematic, interactive 3D architectural environment.

Concept:

"ONE BUILDING. THREE DISCIPLINES. ONE SUSTAINABLE FUTURE."

Visual scenario:

A sophisticated architectural structure appears in a minimal spatial environment.

The building is initially represented through precise parametric wireframes.

As the camera moves forward, the structure progressively becomes a detailed architectural model.

The model then separates into three coordinated layers:

Layer 01 — Architecture:
A refined architectural volume, façade geometry, spatial organization and urban context.

Layer 02 — Energy:
An exploded visualization of thermal envelope, sunlight, daylight distribution, airflow and renewable energy.

Layer 03 — Structure:
A structural skeleton revealing columns, beams, cores and seismic-resistance concepts.

The three systems then merge into one integrated building.

The final composition represents ISB's multidisciplinary philosophy.

3D implementation:
- React Three Fiber.
- Three.js.
- WebGL.
- GSAP for controlled transitions.
- ScrollTrigger where appropriate.
- Physically based materials.
- Realistic lighting.
- Ambient occlusion.
- Subtle reflections.
- Carefully optimized geometry.

Camera behavior:
- Cinematic perspective.
- Controlled camera movement.
- Subtle mouse parallax on desktop.
- Scroll-driven transitions.
- Smooth transitions between architectural states.
- No aggressive or disorienting camera movement.

The camera experience must feel like exploring an architectural model in a high-end digital exhibition.

Hero text:

Primary:
"Beyond Architecture.
Towards a Sustainable Future."

Persian alternative:
«فراتر از معماری؛ در مسیر آینده‌ای پایدار»

Supporting text:
"Integrating Architecture, Engineering and Building Intelligence."

CTA 01:
Explore Our Projects

CTA 02:
Discover ISB

Add a subtle scroll indicator.

The 3D model must remain visually impressive without compromising text readability.

On mobile:
Use a simplified optimized 3D scene or a high-quality rendered fallback. Never force a heavy desktop scene onto a mobile device.

Respect prefers-reduced-motion and provide a static fallback.

The first meaningful content must appear immediately, even if the 3D scene is still loading.

