**Phase 02 — Figma & UX**
Create the sitemap, user journeys, design system, wireframes, responsive layouts and interactive prototypes.

**Phase 03 — Visual Development**
Implement the homepage, navigation, typography system, project gallery and three-dimensional hero.

**Phase 04 — Corporate Platform**
Develop all department pages, service pages, project details, about page and contact system.

**Phase 05 — Academy & Commerce**
Develop course catalog, course details, accounts, dashboards, cart and payment integration.

**Phase 06 — CMS & Backend**
Implement content management, authentication, database structure, permissions and server-side operations.

**Phase 07 — Optimization**
Improve performance, accessibility, SEO, responsive behavior and security.

**Phase 08 — Final QA**
Run complete functional and visual tests.

Do not attempt to generate the entire platform as one uncontrolled code dump.

Build incrementally while maintaining a consistent design system and working application.

After each phase:
1. Summarize what has actually been implemented.
2. List remaining work.
3. Identify missing assets or credentials.
4. Test the relevant features.
5. Continue to the next phase without unnecessarily redesigning completed components.

